  howToPlayContent: 'KEEP EVERY MONKEY FED, CALM AND CLEAN.


    CLICK A MONKEY
    TO SELECT THEM. USE THE CONSOLE BUTTONS TO FEED, CLEAN OR SEND THEM TO TIME-OUT.
    CHANGE CAMERAS TO WATCH EVERY ROOM.


    WHEN THE ALARM SOUNDS, WATCH THE LINE-UP.
    TRUST IS A PATTERN: USE WHO EACH MONKEY POINTS AT AND HOW RELIABLE THEY ARE TO
    FIND THE CULPRIT. ONE WRONG ZOOLAG PICK ENDS THE RUN.


    M  MONKEY ROSTER    
    ESC / P  PAUSE'
